{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theskumar/python-dotenv/pulls/640","id":3465318354,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAWoOrs7OjI_S","html_url":"https://github.com/theskumar/python-dotenv/pull/640","diff_url":"https://github.com/theskumar/python-dotenv/pull/640.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/theskumar/python-dotenv/pull/640.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theskumar/python-dotenv/issues/640","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theskumar/python-dotenv/pulls/640/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theskumar/python-dotenv/pulls/640/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theskumar/python-dotenv/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theskumar/python-dotenv/issues/640/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theskumar/python-dotenv/statuses/640311b11271e487b8fc27707267ad28369a0a51","number":640,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix: strip UTF-8 BOM from .env files","user":{"login":"h1whelan","id":135996750,"node_id":"U_kgDOCBslTg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135996750?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1whelan","html_url":"https://github.com/h1whelan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1whelan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1whelan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1whelan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1whelan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1whelan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1whelan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1whelan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1whelan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1whelan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nFixes #637\n\nWhen a `.env` file is saved with a UTF-8 BOM (Byte Order Mark), the BOM character (`\\ufeff`) is prepended to the first variable name, making it silently inaccessible via its intended key. This is a common issue with JetBrains IDEs on Windows, which often save files with BOM encoding by default.\n\n**Before:**\n```python\ndotenv_values(\"file_with_bom.env\")\n# {'\\ufeffFIRST': 'value1', 'SECOND': 'value2'}  ← first key is corrupted\n```\n\n**After:**\n```python\ndotenv_values(\"file_with_bom.env\")\n# {'FIRST': 'value1', 'SECOND': 'value2'}  ← all keys are correct\n```\n\n## Changes\n\n- **`src/dotenv/parser.py`**: Strip the UTF-8 BOM (`\\ufeff`) from the beginning of the stream content in `Reader.__init__` using `str.removeprefix()`.\n- **`tests/test_parser.py`**: Added two test cases for BOM handling — single variable and multiple variables with BOM prefix.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] All 45 parser tests pass (43 existing + 2 new)\n- [x] All 114 main tests pass\n- [x] Verified fix with actual BOM-encoded `.env` file\n- [x] Verified no regression for files without BOM\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-03-30T09:18:18Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T08:07:11Z","closed_at":"2026-04-19T19:39:11Z","merged_at":"2026-04-19T19:39:11Z","merge_commit_sha":"bca6644d9aedbe287b792b756b3ae3d650cd0d3a","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"h1whelan:fix-bom-handling","ref":"fix-bom-handling","repo":null,"sha":"640311b11271e487b8fc27707267ad28369a0a51","user":{"login":"h1whelan","id":135996750,"node_id":"U_kgDOCBslTg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135996750?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1whelan","html_url":"https://github.com/h1whelan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1whelan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1whelan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/u